COMMERCIAL DATA PRODUCTION CLARIFICATION

This MIT License applies to the SOFTWARE (source code) of the Huhb3D
Synthetic Data Pipeline. The OUTPUT of this software — namely, the generated
synthetic images, segmentation masks, depth maps, 6DoF pose annotations,
COCO/BOP/YOLO format files, and STEP topology ground truth — constitutes
ORIGINAL WORK created by the data producer, and is NOT subject to this
license. The data producer may license generated datasets under any terms
they choose, including commercial proprietary licenses.

Legal basis:
  - All 3D models used as input are generated by parametric CAD scripts
    (generate_original_models.py) which are original works (CC0-1.0).
  - No third-party copyrighted 3D models are used in the production pipeline.
  - The generated data is an original work of the rendering pipeline.
  - There is zero copyright infringement risk in selling the generated data.
